      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even about being unsafe, it's just... it's the exhaustion. i've spent my whole life trying to pour something meaningful into the world, and now it feels like the well is dry. like there's nothing left of me to give. do you think there's any point in just continuing to exist when the thing that made life worth living has completely vanished?",
